Local patches on top of vanilla dwm from suckless.org (see ../README).

Apply in one shot from the repository root:

	./patches/apply

Or manually:

	for p in patches/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-*.diff; do git apply "$p"; done

Then:

	cp config.def.h config.h   # or: make config.h
	make

Patches (order):
  0001-gitignore.diff      — ignore build products and generated config.h
  0002-config.def.h.diff   — rules, keys, colors, layouts, spawn commands
  0003-drw.diff            — drw.c, drw.h
  0004-util.diff           — util.c, util.h
  0005-dwm.diff            — dwm.c (largest)

Regenerate from a full tree with: git diff upstream/master..HEAD (split by file as needed).
